{
  "info": {
    "name": "12-actuator 应用监控验收",
    "description": "模块 12 验收集合：健康检查 → 业务打点 → 指标查询 → Prometheus 导出 → 未暴露端点 404。\n\n运行前置：应用已启动在 http://127.0.0.1:8012（IDEA 跑 ActuatorApplication 或 mvn -pl 12-actuator spring-boot:run）。\n导入后 Apifox 会把 baseUrl 变量转为环境的「服务」前置 URL。\n\n断言写在每条接口的「后置操作-自定义脚本」里；用「自动化测试」把 11 条按顺序引用运行，30 条断言应全绿。\n注意执行顺序不能乱：business.orders.failed 是懒注册的，05 依赖 04 先跑过。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8012",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 健康检查",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/health",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "health"]
        },
        "description": "验收点：自定义 InventoryHealthIndicator 被装进组件树，且带判断依据（url / latencyMs）。Bean 名 @Component(\"inventory\") 就是响应里的 key。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// 验收点 1：整体状态与 HTTP 200 一致",
              "pm.test('整体状态 UP', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('UP');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 验收点 2：自定义组件进了组件树，名字就是 @Component(\"inventory\")",
              "pm.test('自定义 inventory 组件存在且 UP', function () {",
              "  const inv = pm.response.json().components.inventory;",
              "  pm.expect(inv !== undefined).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(inv.status).to.eql('UP');",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 验收点 3：健康检查不是只有 UP/DOWN，还带排查依据",
              "pm.test('inventory 带 url 与 latencyMs 依据', function () {",
              "  const d = pm.response.json().components.inventory.details;",
              "  pm.expect(d.url).to.eql('http://inventory-service/health');",
              "  pm.expect(typeof d.latencyMs === 'number').to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 验收点 4：内置组件没被覆盖掉",
              "pm.test('内置 ping / diskSpace / livenessState 仍在', function () {",
              "  const c = pm.response.json().components;",
              "  pm.expect(c.ping.status).to.eql('UP');",
              "  pm.expect(c.diskSpace.status).to.eql('UP');",
              "  pm.expect(c.livenessState.status).to.eql('UP');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 下单（打点）",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/business/orders?amount=199",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["business", "orders"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "amount", "value": "199", "description": "订单金额" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "验收点：业务接口正常返回，返回体带耗时——这一笔会被 BusinessMetrics 记进 Counter + Timer。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('下单成功，code=200', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('返回 orderId 与 costMs', function () {",
              "  const d = pm.response.json().data;",
              "  pm.expect(d.orderId > 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(typeof d.costMs === 'number').to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 慢请求（撑 P95）",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/business/slow?ms=300",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["business", "slow"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "ms", "value": "300", "description": "睡眠毫秒数" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "验收点：制造一个 300ms 的大样本。连续跑 3~5 次再去查 07，MAX/P95 会被明显拉高——这是演示「分位数怎么来的」最直观的一步。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('慢请求确实耗时 >= 300ms', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime >= 300).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 下单失败（带标签打点）",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/business/fail?reason=stock_empty",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["business", "fail"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "reason", "value": "stock_empty", "description": "失败原因，换一个值就多一条序列" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "验收点：同一个指标名按 reason 分成独立序列。把 reason 改成 pay_timeout 再跑一次，之后在指标端点里能看到两条。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('失败打点接口可访问', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.reason).to.eql('stock_empty');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 指标清单",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "metrics"]
        },
        "description": "验收点：四个自定义指标都注册成功。注意 business.orders.failed 是懒注册的——跑过 04 才会出现，所以本集合必须按顺序执行。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('四个自定义指标都在清单里', function () {",
              "  const names = pm.response.json().names;",
              "  const expect = [",
              "    'business.orders.created',",
              "    'business.orders.failed',",
              "    'business.order.handle',",
              "    'business.orders.processing'",
              "  ];",
              "  expect.forEach(function (n) {",
              "    pm.expect(names.indexOf(n) >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  });",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('自带 http.server.requests / jvm.memory.used 存在', function () {",
              "  const names = pm.response.json().names;",
              "  pm.expect(names.indexOf('http.server.requests') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(names.indexOf('jvm.memory.used') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 单个指标：Counter",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/business.orders.created",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "metrics", "business.orders.created"]
        },
        "description": "验收点：Counter 只有 COUNT 一个测量值，且全局打上了 application 标签（来自 management.metrics.tags）。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Counter 有 COUNT 且大于 0', function () {",
              "  const m = pm.response.json().measurements;",
              "  pm.expect(m.length).to.eql(1);",
              "  pm.expect(m[0].statistic).to.eql('COUNT');",
              "  pm.expect(m[0].value > 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('自动带上 application 标签', function () {",
              "  const tags = pm.response.json().availableTags;",
              "  const app = tags.filter(function (t) { return t.tag === 'application'; });",
              "  pm.expect(app.length).to.eql(1);",
              "  pm.expect(app[0].values[0]).to.eql('12-应用监控');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "07 单个指标：Timer（按 result 筛序列）",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/business.order.handle?tag=result:success",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "metrics", "business.order.handle"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "tag", "value": "result:success", "description": "标签过滤，格式 key:value。改成 result:failure 能看到另一条独立序列" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "验收点：Timer 是三件套（COUNT / TOTAL_TIME / MAX），MAX 会被 03 的 300ms 慢请求撑起来——这就是 P95 的来源。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Timer 三个统计量齐全', function () {",
              "  const stats = pm.response.json().measurements.map(function (m) { return m.statistic; });",
              "  pm.expect(stats.indexOf('COUNT') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(stats.indexOf('TOTAL_TIME') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(stats.indexOf('MAX') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// ?tag= 过滤后 availableTags 只返回「剩下的」标签，result 已被用掉所以看不到——",
              "// 看不到 result 恰恰说明过滤生效了",
              "pm.test('?tag=result:success 后 availableTags 不再含 result', function () {",
              "  const tags = pm.response.json().availableTags;",
              "  const r = tags.filter(function (t) { return t.tag === 'result'; });",
              "  pm.expect(r.length).to.eql(0);",
              "  pm.expect(tags.length).to.eql(1);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('MAX 被 300ms 慢请求撑起来', function () {",
              "  const m = pm.response.json().measurements.filter(function (x) { return x.statistic === 'MAX'; });",
              "  pm.expect(m[0].value >= 0.25).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 单个指标：Gauge",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/business.orders.processing",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "metrics", "business.orders.processing"]
        },
        "description": "验收点（最容易被问的）：这里永远是 0。不是没打点，是 Gauge 只在被抓取那一刻读值，而请求早就结束了。对照单元测试 BusinessMetricsTest.gaugeTracksProcessing——enter() 后立刻读就能读到 2。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Gauge 有值且当前为 0（请求已结束）', function () {",
              "  const m = pm.response.json().measurements;",
              "  pm.expect(m[0].statistic).to.eql('VALUE');",
              "  pm.expect(m[0].value).to.eql(0);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 Prometheus 导出",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "prometheus"]
        },
        "description": "验收点（整个模块最值得讲的一处）：代码里叫 business.orders.created，导出来却是 business_orders_total。名字被 Micrometer 的命名约定改了：点转下划线、created 保留后缀被吃、补 _total。Timer 导出为 summary，分位数变成 quantile 标签。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const body = pm.response.text();",
              "",
              "pm.test('business.orders.created 导出为 business_orders_total', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(body.indexOf('business_orders_total') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(body.indexOf('# TYPE business_orders_total counter') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Timer 导出为 summary + quantile 标签', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(body.indexOf('# TYPE business_order_handle_seconds summary') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  pm.expect(body.indexOf('quantile=\"0.95\"') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('失败计数按 reason 拆行', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(body.indexOf('reason=\"stock_empty\"') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('每条自定义序列都带 application 标签', function () {",
              "  const lines = body.split('\\n').filter(function (l) {",
              "    return l.indexOf('business_orders') === 0 || l.indexOf('business_order_handle') === 0;",
              "  });",
              "  pm.expect(lines.length > 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  lines.forEach(function (l) {",
              "    pm.expect(l.indexOf('application=\"12-应用监控\"') >= 0).to.eql(true);",
              "  });",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 把关键几行打到控制台，演示时直接念",
              "const keep = body.split('\\n').filter(function (l) {",
              "  return l.indexOf('# TYPE business_') === 0 ||",
              "    (l.indexOf('business_orders_total{') === 0) ||",
              "    (l.indexOf('business_order_handle_seconds{') === 0 && l.indexOf('0.95') >= 0);",
              "});",
              "console.log('=== 关键导出行 ===');",
              "keep.forEach(function (l) { console.log(l); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "10 未暴露端点应 404",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/env",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "env"]
        },
        "description": "验收点：安全面。/actuator/env 能读出全部配置（含密码），所以默认不暴露、这里也没写进 exposure.include。返回 404 才是正确行为。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('env 端点未暴露，返回 404', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "});",
              "",
              "// 对照：已暴露的 metrics 是 200，说明不是整个 actuator 都关了",
              "pm.sendRequest('http://127.0.0.1:8012/actuator/metrics', function (err, res) {",
              "  pm.test('对照：metrics 仍可访问', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(res.code).to.eql(200);",
              "  });",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "11 info 端点",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/actuator/info",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["actuator", "info"]
        },
        "description": "验收点：AppInfoContributor（代码写入）与 application.yml 的 info.*（静态配置）合并输出。注意 Boot 4 默认不发 info.* 配置（management.info.env.enabled 默认 false），本项目已显式打开。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('InfoContributor 的 module 与 owner 生效', function () {",
              "  const j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.module.name).to.eql('12-应用监控');",
              "  pm.expect(j.owner.team).to.eql('backend-learning');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('application.yml 的 info.app 也在', function () {",
              "  const j = pm.response.json();",
              "  pm.expect(j.app.module).to.eql('12-actuator');",
              "  pm.expect(j.app.version).to.eql('1.0.0');",
              "  pm.expect(j.module.port).to.eql('8012');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
